sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant FE as Next.js app
  participant API as FastAPI / WS Lambda
  participant AZ as AuthZ check
  participant AG as Strands agent
  participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
  participant LLM as LLM provider
  U->>FE: Ask question
  FE->>API: chat message (JWT, tenant)
  API->>AZ: Check permission + tenant (RLS context)
  AZ-->>API: Allowed
  API->>AG: Run with user context (guardrails on input)
  AG->>DB: Vector search rule library
  AG->>LLM: Prompt + sources
  LLM-->>AG: Answer or tool call
  AG->>DB: Tool: read client risk (RLS)
  AG->>LLM: Final answer
  AG-->>API: Answer + citations (guardrails on output)
  API->>DB: Write audit + usage + cost
  API-->>FE: Stream tokens, citations, done
